## Third-Party Content License Notice

This repository contains prompt text content collected from various open-source
projects. Each prompt entry includes its original source and license information
in the `source_license` field.

The original content licenses include:
- MIT License (majority of content)
- CC BY 4.0 (some content)

Please refer to the `source_license` field in each data entry for specific
license information.

